                    Files, Vietnam Country Series, 8/24/63-8/31/63, Memos and Miscellaneous. Top
                    Secret. A note on the source text indicates that this document was taken from
                    the President’s weekend reading, dated August 24.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d278-f2" n="2" xml:id="d278-f2-content">
